pe\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"Yes, you have full control over all generated content. While our AI creates highly optimized applications, you can always review and modify any part of your CV, cover letter, or profile suggestions to better match your preferences or add personal touches.\"}},{\"@type\":\"Question\",\"name\":\"What makes ApplyKit.ai different from other job application tools?\",\"acceptedAnswer\":{\"@type\":\"Answer\",\"text\":\"ApplyKit.ai is the only tool that combines LinkedIn profile optimization, ATS-friendly CV generation, and custom cover letters in one seamless solution. We're focused on not just creating documents, but optimizing your entire application process with proven techniques that increase your chances of getting hired.\"}}]}]"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"0:{\"P\":null,\"b\":\"cumlY3yt1hSVibmDlIUw5\",\"p\":\"\",\"c\":[\"\",\"\"],\"i\":false,\"f\":[[[\"\",{\"children\":[\"__PAGE__\",{}]},\"$undefined\",\"$undefined\",true],[\"\",[\"$\",\"$5\",\"c\",{\"children\":[[[\"$\",\"link\",\"0\",{\"rel\":\"stylesheet\",\"href\":\"/_next/static/css/2e5ef21cfa4114f8.css\",\"precedence\":\"next\",\"crossOrigin\":\"$undefined\",\"nonce\":\"$undefined\"}]],[\"$\",\"html\",null,{\"lang\":\"en\",\"className\":\"__variable_3c557b\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"body\",null,{\"className\":\"__variable_1e4310 __variable_c3aa02 __variable_3c557b antialiased\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"script\",null,{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$6\"}}],[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{}],[\"$\",\"$L8\",null,{\"parallelRouterKey\":\"children\",\"segmentPath\":[\"children\"],\"error\":\"$undefined\",\"errorStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"errorScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"template\":[\"$\",\"$L9\",null,{}],\"templateStyles\":\"$undefined\",\"templateScripts\":\"$undefined\",\"notFound\":[[\"$\",\"title\",null,{\"children\":\"404: This page could not be found.\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"style\":{\"fontFamily\":\"system-ui,\\\"Segoe UI\\\",Roboto,Helveti